Run this example in a fresh database:
```sql
CREATE TABLE morning(name TEXT);
CREATE TABLE evening(name TEXT);
INSERT INTO morning VALUES ('Ari'), ('Bo'), ('Bo');
INSERT INTO evening VALUES ('Bo'), ('Cy');
SELECT name FROM morning
INTERSECT
SELECT name FROM evening
ORDER BY name;
SELECT name FROM morning
EXCEPT
SELECT name FROM evening
ORDER BY name;
```
The two queries compare the same pair of lists.
